# Article Embeddings — model + vocab assets for M15 article-content search.
# Downloaded by scripts/bootstrap-assets.sh (reproducible from
# scripts/model/build-st-coreml.py) — don't commit them.
# Phase 3.1 model survey concluded MiniLM-L6 is the production choice
# (see docs/article-embeddings.md). ane-distilbert / bge-small / gte-small /
# e5-small / MiniLM-L12 are negative results, intentionally NOT bundled.
#
# .mlpackage = source-of-truth (output of scripts/model/build-st-coreml.py).
# .mlmodelc  = pre-compiled output of scripts/precompile-article-embed-model.sh.
#              Pre-compiled because Xcode auto-compiles .mlpackage during
#              the Sources build phase, which prevents ODR ASSET_TAGS
#              from applying — see docs/article-embeddings.md, "Phase 3.5",
#              for the full Xcode-quirk write-up.
all-MiniLM-L6-v2.mlpackage/
all-MiniLM-L6-v2.mlmodelc/
vocab.txt
# Bootstrap / precompile bookkeeping and crash leftovers.
all-MiniLM-L6-v2.mlmodelc.sha256
.precompile.*/
.bootstrap-tmp.*/
